@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
title DELETE /api/workspace/v1/messenger/folders/{folder_uuid}
actor "客户端" as Client
participant "控制器 RestAlchemy" as API
database "PostgreSQL\nFOLDER + USER_FOLDER_BINDING" as DB
queue "交易 outbox" as OUT
queue "标式化投影任务" as TASK
participant "沃克人游泳池" as WORKER
database "公众活动存储器" as EVENT
participant "控制器 WebSocket" as DISP
participant "签名客户端" as WS
Client -> API: DELETE 文件
note right of API
  系统性 USER_FOLDER_BINDING 这条路线不会删除.
  投影: 活跃的 USER_STREAM_BINDING + 规范性 STREAM.is_archived = false.
  All chats = 所有的; Personal = STREAM.private = true; Channels = STREAM.private = false.
end note
API -> DB: BEGIN; 在指定区域中锁定文件
API -> DB: 删除绑定/元素 + FOLDER 通过生命周期 FK
API -> OUT: 添加 folder.deleted
API -> DB: COMMIT
API --> Client: 204 没有答案
OUT -> TASK: immutable folder_projection(outbox_event_uuid, scope=user-folder)
TASK -> WORKER: claim user-folder(project,user,folder)\nlease + fencing
group 一个 worker DB transaction
  WORKER -> DB: idempotent tombstone effect guard
  WORKER -> EVENT: ready folder.deleted {uuid}
end
DISP -> EVENT: 阅读/重复/播放
DISP -> WS: folder.deleted
@enduml
